# C-path only — not a product backend

Logline: x86 silent-miscompile notes are historical. Product oodac is the C backend. This file is not a live emit-x86 plan.

Setup: Other backends attach only after C check is the front door of build and there is no known C silent-wrong ELF.

Beats:
  1. Product `--backend` accepts `c` only. Residual backends exit 2.
  2. Do not add `x86_emit_*.oo` as a success path.
  3. C lowering must fail closed rather than emit a lying ELF.

Status: not a product backend. C path only.
